#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:20 847298d4eb6e454aa30f3c1539f02d5e
msgid "Parameters for full text index when building table:"
msgstr "建表时的全文索引参数："

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:22 e5df895327614e409891be38ace7c189
msgid ""
"text_id is required, full-text index unique identification ID, ID > 0, text_id "
"can be feature_id, if it is INT64 type, if you want to index text_id, you need "
"to add one more parameter with the same name in TEXT()."
msgstr ""
"text_id 是必填项，全文索引唯一标识 ID，ID > 0，text_id 可以是 feature_id，如果"
"是 INT64 类型，如果要索引 text_id，需要在 TEXT() 中再添加一个同名参数。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:24 058d38fe1a6f4a7fbe3faa4919bd74ca
msgid ""
"description, category, rating are the fields of full text index, only 4 types "
"are allowed: INT64, DOUBLE, STRING, BYTES, the fields of full text index "
"should include at least two fields, one of the two fields must be text_id."
msgstr ""
"description、category、rating 是全文本索引的字段，只允许使用 4 种类型： 全文本"
"索引的字段至少应包括两个字段，其中一个字段必须是 text_id。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:26 c129d95fbafb476d8881413535ea32c4
msgid ""
"Note: text_fields in parameters is the user filled in about the full-text "
"indexed fields of the word splitter parameters, must be full-text indexed "
"fields are filled in."
msgstr ""
"注：text_fields 中的参数是用户填写的有关全文索引字段的分词器参数，必须是全文索"
"引字段中填写的内容。"

