#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:43 e79d1a2818544a8faf978f91fe18d98f
msgid ""
"New text_search function for full-text index bm25 recall, the first parameter "
"is the table name, the second parameter is the full-text index name, the third "
"parameter is the expression used for retrieval, need to comply with the "
"Tantivy requirements of the expression, please note that whether the "
"expression is legal or not, it is Tantivy check. If the third parameter is not "
"written, the default is a null character. The fourth parameter is similar to "
"the vector's top 5, returning the top 5 rows with the highest scores. If the "
"four parameters are not written, the default is 1."
msgstr ""
"新增 text_search 函数，用于全文索引 bm25 的调用，第一个参数是表名，第二个参数是"
"全文索引名，第三个参数是用于检索的表达式，需要符合 Tantivy 对表达式的要求，请注"
"意表达式是否合法，这需要 Tantivy 检查。如果未写入第三个参数，则默认为空字符。第"
"四个参数类似于向量的 top 5，返回得分最高的前 5 行。如果未写入这四个参数，默认值"
"为 1。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:44 912fd67052474560b03cc17ac170a728
msgid ""
"Note: The third parameter retrieves the expression used to retrieve multiple "
"clauses is when the logical operation OR, AND will be used, which must be used "
"in uppercase. If it is lowercase, there will be different semantics. tantivy "
"will be treated as multiple words in the corresponding field to match, rather "
"than multiple clauses to match."
msgstr ""
"注意：当使用逻辑运算 OR、AND 时，第三个参数将检索用于检索多个条款的表达式，该表"
"达式必须使用大写。如果是小写，则语义不同。tantivy 将被视为相应字段中的多个要匹"
"配的单词，而不是多个要匹配的条款。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:46
