#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:59 9d9f6c22fc54409f87b436ae62b61fca
msgid "Get the 5 rows with the highest scores and sort them by rank_bm25 score."
msgstr "获取得分最高的 5 行，并按 rank_bm25 分数排序。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:61 b6ff4aefb7ca4d5493632986829e88f9
msgid "Multi-way Recall"
msgstr "多路召回"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_document.md:79 789702531c054ad4ac4ccbe02acb0574
msgid ""
"Support hybrid_search function, realize the full-text index and vector hybrid "
"search, the first parameter is the full-text index query, the second parameter "
"is the vector index query, the third parameter is the weight of the full-text "
"index search, the fourth parameter is the weight of the vector search. The "
"third and fourth parameters if omitted, the default is 0.5. which such as "
"paradeDB in similarity_limit_n, bm25_limit_n, Dingo is through the "
"corresponding function in the top parameter specified."
msgstr ""
"支持 hybrid_search 函数，实现全文索引和向量混合搜索，第一个参数是全文索引查询，"
"第二个参数是向量索引查询，第三个参数是全文索引搜索的权重，第四个参数是向量搜索"
"的权重。其中如 paradeDB 中的 similarity_limit_n、bm25_limit_n、Dingo 等都是通过"
"相应函数中的顶层参数指定的。"

